Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:19.25,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Not knowing happiness is the only one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The one who could not understand its call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may swallow you. The flow may swallow you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may swallow you. The flow may swallow you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.05,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To be with you longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:50.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I just returned to duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought that you didn't have permission\Nto be released from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:56.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:59.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't be the only one\Nbedridden at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:02.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm the one who called Togusa back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:04.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The necessary documents have been assembled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:07.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will have you go with me to\Nthe Prime Minister's residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.51,0:02:08.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:10.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:11.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're not fully healed yet, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:13.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.31,0:02:18.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, it was Togusa who made\Nthe first connection in the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:26.82,Default,,550,0,450,,{\b1\i1}The Sun Sets \N on an \NIsolated Fortress{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:30.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.18,0:02:32.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have an emergency transmission\Nfrom the Minister of the interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:34.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, put it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:38.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aramaki-kun, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you watching channel W-3?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:41.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, please look at it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:55.44,Default,,0,750,225,,{\b1\i1}The truth behind the laughing man case?{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:55.44,Default,,0,0,105,,{\b1}Was the Ministry of the Interior's Public Safety Organisation involved in Mr Serano's Kidnapping?{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:03:06.20,Default,,0,900,110,,{\b1\i1}Niihama Prefecture, Niihama City \N Public Safety Headquarters{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.90,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1}Members of Public Safety's Section 9, an\Norganisation under the Ministry of the Interior,{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1}is now thought to have been involved in the attempted\Nkidnapping of Serano Genomix's president, Mr. Earnest Serano.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:03:05.99,Default,,1250,0,775,,{\b1}Was the Ministry of the Interior's \N Public Safety Organisation \N involved in Mr Serano's Kidnapping?{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:03:00.60,Default,,0,650,750,,{\b1}Section 9, an organisation within the Ministry of the Interior,\Nis recognised as an international rescue unit.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.70,0:03:06.00,Default,,0,750,750,,{\b1}However, its excessive intelligence activities and\Nuse of force have been cause for much concern.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1}From this case, there is a high possibility that Section 9 has been\Ninvolved in the chain of events of the Laughing Man Case in 2024...{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:14.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:17.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am attending an emergency cabinet meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What an unnecessary hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should come here immediately as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:24.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And it would be best for you to come up\Nwith answers while you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:28.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Does this mean that information\Nwas leaked beforehand, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:32.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't panic. This merely means that\Nour plan has been set into motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:35.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will proceed to the Prime\NMinister's residence as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:38.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:39.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Determine where the leak occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:42.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:51.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With this, we will now need to conduct a sweeping\Nreview regarding the need for Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:54.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Social unrest, which has been\Nsteadily increasing after Section
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:57.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,9's existence was exposed, has\Ngone beyond the critical point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:00.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Prime Minister, while Public Safety officially lies\Nunder the Ministry of the Interior's jurisdiction,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:05.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have heard that there are certain instances\Nin which you can issue direct orders as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:09.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, such things have been\Nknown to happen before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:17.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it is also true that Section 9 is quite valuable\Nas an international rescue unit with combat experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:22.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How easily you say such things when you didn't\Neven know what was happening in your own turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:27.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Section 9 is an assassins group. In\Nthe war's aftermath, its creation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.03,0:04:31.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,was approved without debate based on\Nthe then Prime Minister's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:37.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Considering the Article 9 issue regarding our Self Defence Forces, for which no\Nresolution is yet in sight, public opinion is delicately balanced at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:43.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, this discussion will not make any\Nheadway until the Chief of Section 9 arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:50.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:53.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me, everyone. I will return momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:02.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am in a difficult situation thanks to this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:08.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You will not be able to avoid being\Nsummoned to testify under oath, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:13.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am sure you can imagine how dangerous\Nit is for me to meet you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:15.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:17.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However... please see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:19.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:24.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Highly classified documents on Secretary\NGeneral Yakushima that are of grave import.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder if we made it in time for the big bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:45.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who else has seen this cash flow\Nand understand its implications?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:49.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You, who has just read the dossier; Mr.\NSerano, who has hardened
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:53.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,his resolve to accuse the Secretary\NGeneral; and my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:55.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:59.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will deal with Mr. Yakushima\Nat the appropriate time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:04.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, this is a key time\Nbefore the Lower House elections.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:07.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would like to let the people and\Nthe media have the limelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we are to oust someone as\Nprominent as Yakushima-San,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:14.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a substantial degree of sacrifice\Non our part can not be avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:17.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I fail to grasp exactly what you mean by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:23.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am referring to the enactment of\Nthe Special Forces Control Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.47,0:06:25.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you telling me to toss\NSection 9 out the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:27.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I did not say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:28.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait a minute, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:33.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My trust in my subordinates, whose faith in\Nme never wavers under any circumstances...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:38.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that {\i1}faith{\i} encompasses the totality of the\N"wealth" that I've strived to create!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And you're trying to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:43.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It appears that the time has\Ncome to utilise that wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will make the necessary preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:48.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You will summon your subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:53.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't worry. As long as you are here,\Nyou'll be able to restructure Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go to the Ministry of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:12.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:18.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Were you able to persuade the Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:21.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Order all members to Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Any other orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:28.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Survive, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:47.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The enemy has nine sentient tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.23,0:07:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Teams 3 and 4, drop down to the\Nheliport and infiltrate the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Our highest priority is to neutralise those tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:59.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Teams 5 and 6, secure the seven main members ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will seize control of the entire facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:03.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Upon infiltration, set your\Ncyberbrain to autistic mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:05.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The enemy is adept at information warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:07.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will overtake them by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:49.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll shake them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:34.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have come to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:41.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You still have something you must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To make all the necessary arrangements\Nin this short a time period...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:50.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Prime Minister is indeed competent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:53.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They must be attempting to\Nneutralise Section 9 by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did you say...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:01.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:02.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:07.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:08.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:10.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:22.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doesn't something feel different about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:25.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Plus, this call is kind of weird, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:28.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't have time to explain\Nthe situation right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:30.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For now, carry out my orders\Nwithout asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:34.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bring six backup cybernetic bodies\Nto the command centre ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:37.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Could it be that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:40.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, what is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.48,0:11:01.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will give you these "seeds".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:05.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After you get out of here, leak the information\Ninside the seeds to the media and let them sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Public support will be crucial if we\Nare to oust the Secretary General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:43.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Brought them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:47.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I received an encrypted\Ntransmission from the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:50.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I predict that a special op unit from the military\Nwill soon arrive to neutralise this facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:54.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As I'd thought, the Special\NForces Control Bill was invoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:57.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By the time that military force is\Nauthorizes through an emergency
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,cabinet meeting, everything will\Nhave already been taken care of...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:00.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it's nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:03.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:08.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After we buy as much time as we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we'll shut this place down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:24.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've secured the hangar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:27.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No sign of sentient tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:28.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Beware of ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:33.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Colonel, a terminal has a record stating that\Nthe sentient tanks were sent to the labs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:35.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dammit! The command's\Nintelligence is always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:37.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cut the chatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:39.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The situation is subject to change in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:42.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take all possibilities into\Nconsideration and deploy the teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:48.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whoo, here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:52.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:13:00.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, activate the sprinklers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:11.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's just water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Team 2, provide backup support!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:16.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Use that reinforced exoskeleton to overwhelm them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:20.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:23.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can't buy any time against that exoskeleton\Nno matter how much we fire at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:38.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where the hell is that unit from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:44.92,Default,,1250,0,700,,{\b1\i1}Umibouzu means \N "sea monk" or "sea priest",  \N a supernatural creature \N from Japanese folklore{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:41.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're the Umibouzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:43.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Umibouzu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:45.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:48.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They took part in the\NNemuro Recapture Operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:50.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're famous in the underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:54.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since they're not supposed to exist,\Nthey don't have an official name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.81,0:14:05.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's about time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:06.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.75,0:14:35.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give me a status report!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:37.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Expedite recovery of casualties!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:45.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it appears that Section 9\Nmembers committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:51.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Account for the possibility that it is a subterfuge\Nto make it look as if they committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:54.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:56.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Continue with the search!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:57.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:09.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, jeez, look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:11.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't spill your tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:16.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma-Chan really tries a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:20.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's really industrious and became\Nfriends with everyone right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:21.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, it's really a big help...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:25.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but isn't it actually a reject\Nfrom some organisation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:26.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder if they have more like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:27.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,True, true...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.93,0:15:30.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, I wonder what that\Nrobot's original purpose was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:32.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, hey. There's the news!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:33.73,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}We apologise for interrupting the current program,{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:34.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's all watch TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}but we will now report and a Section 9 update.{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:36.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:51.05,Default,,0,900,225,,{\b1\i1}Ministry of the Interior - Anti-terrorism unit{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:51.05,Default,,0,0,125,,{\b1\i1}Clash with the Military upon refusal to comply with the Special Forces Control Bill  /Niihama{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:40.33,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}In the emergency cabinet meeting, in\Nwhich Section 9 was requested to disarm,{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:44.73,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}enforcement of the Special Forces Control Bill was\Napproved with the possibility of using military force.{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.83,0:15:48.83,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}However, Section 9 refuses to comply despite repeated\Nwarnings and now seems prepared to respond with force.{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:52.63,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}A military special ops unit now appears to have\Nbegun an assault on Section 9's headquarters.{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:53.83,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Now for live coverage from the scene.{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:57.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is... about Section 9!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:58.83,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The military special ops unit just landed on the\Nbuilding where Section 9 is headquartered...{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.55,0:16:04.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't seem to have pursuers thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We didn't buy that much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, none of the cyberbrains had heavy use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:13.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well? What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:21.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chief told me not to die and to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.45,0:16:24.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I agree with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:28.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From here on, we will split into\Nthree groups and divide pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:31.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Afterward, each of you will take off\Nand conceal yourselves in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:35.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As of today, Public Safety Section 9 is disbanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:36.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:46.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is heavy damage, but it appears that\Nthese are the remains of the six members.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:49.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We are currently analysing the\Nextent of cyberbrain usage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:52.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Before the analysis results\Ncome through, call Team 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:59.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Assume subterfuge and block all possible routes such as\Nthe elevator shafts, exhaust outlets, and sewage systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:08.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:10.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, you're going first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.89,0:17:14.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When the pursuit catches up, my\Nbody will block the passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:17.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And what if the enemy sets on ambush of the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:22.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where will you be able to run if\NI'm in front and block the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, Section 9 is finally gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:33.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All that we've worked hard to\Ncreate is now cast to the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:34.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:39.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was nice that we had lavish access to the\Ntop-notch maintenance and cutting edge equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:40.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but that was all it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:43.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We just need to find a new sponsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or is there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you sentimentally attached there, Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:50.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now that you mention it, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:53.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, if I did have any, only memories, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:55.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How sentimental of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:02.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh yeah, where is the watch that you always wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:06.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I left it at my bedside in the\Nsafe house, today of all days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:10.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since Section 9 was hit, I'm\Nsure apartment was seized, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:12.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:17.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wasn't that wristwatch a present you received when\Nyou stopped having to re size your cybernetic body?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not that I know who gave it to you, of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:21.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You knew about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:23.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wasn't wearing it out of sentimental value.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:30.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Weren't you insisting on a female\Nbody type because you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:33.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to have a wrist that would be\Nslim enough to wear that watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:36.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can change cyberbrains\Nand cybernetic bodies, sure;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:38.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but there are some things that\Ncan't be changed, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:40.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you getting so fired up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:43.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've been changing cyberbrains and cybernetic\Nbodies to adapt to the relevant circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:45.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, then I will change\Nmemories, too, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Our idle chatter is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:57.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After we get out of here, we can\Nnever contact each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:19:01.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if we are to meet again,\NI may not be who I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:04.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should also prioritise\Nyour own survival, Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:15.46,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Niihama Prefectural Police -- Niihama Police Department{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:15.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As I've already said many times\Nbefore, that is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:19.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, why was Section 9 agent\Ndisguised as the Laughing Man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:21.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and was in contact with the President?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:23.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:24.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:27.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Besides, Section 9 didn't even exist six years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:30.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How can it be involved in the Laughing Man Case?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:34.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As if you people aren't\Nspecialists at falsifying data.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.93,0:19:38.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:42.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Six years ago, I was a detective\Nat police headquarters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:48.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, let's start again,\Nall the way from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:55.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's part our ways here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:57.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I came instead of the Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:37.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have the usual drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:42.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry... I have loans from\Nmy cybernetic body, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:48.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't want to die, don't struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They've even found out about this place already...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:15.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't usually accept jobs\Nfrom anyone else but her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:19.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but since it's an emergency, I guess\NI'll make a special exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:29.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:33.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:37.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:44.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The war is getting worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.90,0:21:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.59,0:21:53.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why are you ordering the armour\Nsuits unit to withdraw?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They are not opponents who can be defeated\Nunless we expend all possible means to do so!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:21:58.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have confirmed neutralization.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:01.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It would not be wise for us to take further\Nconspicuous actions at this point in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:04.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.41,0:22:09.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leave two armors suit units behind\Nand have all the others withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.21,0:22:09.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.01,0:22:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.91,0:22:13.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We were not ordered to withdraw all the units.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:13.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.01,0:22:14.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:39.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it's my life after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:42.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It means I can spend it however I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:19.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:39.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.95,0:24:00.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:00.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:03.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.25,0:24:05.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
